title Home Assistant 0.3.0: keys on the stored dashboard: the focus goes from stop to stop (header toggles, rows); Enter on a light's row toggles it; Enter on the lock's row asks "Unlock Front door?" (as the 0.2.0 tiles), Cancel, then Yes: Unlocked
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO dash

wait 1800
key down
key down
wait 300
shot focus-row
check focus-row
key enter
wait 900
shot toggled
check toggled
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
wait 300
shot focus-lock
check focus-lock
key enter
wait 400
expect text "Unlock Front door?"
expect text "Yes"
expect text "Cancel"
shot confirm-lock
check confirm-lock
key esc
wait 300
expect notext "Unlock Front door?"
expect text "Locked"
key enter
wait 300
key enter
wait 900
expect text "Unlocked"
shot unlocked
check unlocked
expect noquit
